PATH NOTE (no silent drift)
================================================================================
The generated prompt lists the output under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Driving/**`.
The actual XcodeGen spec (`apps/apple/project.yml`) compiles app sources from `Sources/**`
(plus the `TeslaSync/{feature-views,shared-surfaces,...}` surface trees). `TeslaSync/Features`
is NOT a configured source root, so a file placed there would never compile. The real, build-
wired convention -- where the sibling pages `DriveScorePage.swift` / `ChargingDetailPage.swift`
live -- is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Driving/**`. All new files were placed there so they
actually compile into both app targets. This matches the accepted location of every existing
P7 page.

